WEBVTT

00:09:26.568 --> 00:09:30.857
How do you sustain a strong
sexual connection over the long term?

00:09:32.254 --> 00:09:35.380
You look into the eyes
of your best friend,

00:09:35.404 --> 00:09:39.024
and you keep choosing
to find your way back.

00:09:39.833 --> 00:09:41.008
Thank you.

00:09:41.032 --> 00:09:43.795
(Applause)